export anchor ArtDecoNightStyle:
    number: 283
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Art deco night
    idea: A black lacquer and gold night club facade, a sunburst fan crowning the title, symmetric double ruled frames with stepped corners, and files set in a tall gold ruled register.
    base: dark
    palette:
        onyx: #0b0b0d, the page, corner steps and the preview ground
        lacquer: #141418, frames and the style sheet
        panel: #1b1b21, the page inside the preview
        selected: #24211a, the selected row between gold rules
        gold: #d9b45a, rules, fans, headings, the primary button with dark text #120f08, the current nav and Starred
        darkGold: #7d6630, inner rules and fact grid lines, never text
        champagne: #f0e3c0, text and the inner focus ring
        muted: #b9b2a0, meta and labels
        jade: #5cc2a8, Shared
        copper: #e8956b, Uploading and its segments
    type:
        Headings, labels and figures in a geometric sans, Futura, Century
        Gothic, Avenir Next, Josefin Sans, all at 400 weight. The folder
        title is 46px caps tracked 0.22em, frame headings 14px gold caps
        tracked 0.42em, table heads 11px caps tracked 0.26em. Body in Avenir
        Next, Gill Sans, Segoe UI at 15px, file names 16px.
    layout:
        A symmetric facade. A sunburst of fine gold rays and arcs rises
        from behind the centred header, clipped by its section. The header
        has Brightwork Drive in gold, the title Website redesign, a diamond
        rule and a caps breadcrumb with gold diamonds. A centred nav band
        between double gold rules holds the five links, My files as a gold
        block with dark text. Below are two framed columns, a 320px details
        plaque on the left and the register on the right. Each frame has a
        3px double gold border and a small stepped gold square on each
        corner. The plaque shows Details, the preview over fan rays, the
        name, Starred, a two by two grid of facts, full width Share,
        Download and Get link, and a fan shaped storage gauge with six of
        ten blades gold and 64.2 GB of 100 GB used. The register has an
        underlined search, Upload, New folder and a List or Grid switch
        with List gold, then a table captioned Website redesign with 8
        entries, columns Name, Modified and Size, the size right aligned.
        Each name has a gold diamond with the type icon and statuses below
        in spaced caps. The selected row is a warm dark band between gold
        rules with a gold left bar. Uploading shows eight copper segments
        with five filled. Below 1000px the register comes first and the
        plaque follows. Below 700px rows become stacked blocks.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px between frames, 28px frame padding, 12px cells.
    density: Medium. A three column register.
    corners: Square frames with a stepped gold square at each corner. No rounding anywhere.
    borders: 3px double gold round frames, double rules under table heads and round the nav, 1px dark rules between rows.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from double rules and inset gold rings on the primary button.
    icons:
        1.5px line icons inside gold diamonds. Status is a spaced caps word
        with a star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an up arrow for
        Uploading and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px champagne outline offset 3px, then a dark gap and a gold ring.
    tone: Formal and spare, such as Register, Details and 8 entries.
